  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tanzania Education Network (TEN/MET) implementerar en strategis plan  f&#xf6;r juli 2007-juni 2011 avseende st&#xf6;d till akt&#xf6;rer inom civila        samh&#xe4;llet som arbetar f&#xf6;r r&#xe4;tten till utbildning och som &#xf6;nskar att   tillsammans med andra p&#xe5;verka styrdokument avseende kvalitet i        grundutbildning f&#xf6;r alla i Tanzania.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Education Network (TEN/MET)is implementing its Strategic     Plan July 2007-June 2011 to support actors in civil society to        advocate for the right to education and articulate their concerns     with an informed collective voice to influence policies for quality   basic education for all in Tanzania.</narrative>
